# Spider corpus (~1.4 GB) and the large generated corpora are local only.
# The small summary artifacts that back every number in the paper ARE tracked,
# so the results can be checked without downloading Spider (~26 KB total).
external/data/*
!external/data/derived/
external/data/derived/*
!external/data/derived/baseline_comparison.json
!external/data/derived/division_summary_all.json
!external/data/derived/division_summary_dev.json
!external/data/derived/failure_probes.json
!external/data/derived/in_domain_alternates.json
!external/data/derived/perf_bench.json
!external/data/derived/spider_alternates_dev_summary.json
!external/data/derived/spider_wrong_dev_summary.json
!external/data/derived/residual_summary_dev.json
# The residual corpus and its adjudication packet stay out on purpose. The
# corpus and sample are bulky and regenerate from a fixed seed. The packet is
# different: sheet_rater*.csv and answer_key.csv are the blind sheets and the
# sealed key, and this repository is public. A rater who found the key here
# would stop being an independent rater, and the agreement figure would be
# measuring the repository rather than their judgement.
# Generated test fixtures
external/fixtures/mini_spider/
